    "text": "By Gordon Ramsay ,\n10 hours ago SIOUX FALLS, SOUTH DAKOTA — A significant severe weather threat is gearing up across the Northern Plains today Wednesday June 3, 2026, as Max Velocity Weather Categorical Outlook updated at 3:34 AM ET shows a Slight Risk zone centered over the Rapid City and Sioux Falls corridor with very large hail, damaging winds, and a couple of tornadoes all possible this afternoon and evening. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
